    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.bxduXJhh2oXcM6Uy]{Profile: Whitmore's Wolves}</p><blockquote><p><em>The Sheriff&#39;s pack.</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Type</th><td>Sbirri</td></tr><tr><th>Domain</th><td>The farm and the Snohomish Valley</td></tr><tr><th>Location</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.NNzMhIvsavpG0iTQ]{The Sheriff&#39;s Farm and Boat Landing}</td></tr><tr><th>Members</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.1UgmJAqeofD7SSaf]{Ethan Montgomery}, @UUID[JournalEntry.B4nqUk8dojvCw97H]{Halvard “Hal” Brekke}, @UUID[Actor.L1oU4dlqHg8Yszon]{Montgomery&#39;s Bounty Hunters}</td></tr><tr><th>Allies</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.3zcQLj7aEAxHT0Yr]{David Smith}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The ones who clean up the city while the Prince raises a glass in the Gallery.</p><h3>Domain</h3><ul><li><strong>Chasse 3:</strong> truckers, hunters, rest areas</li><li><strong>Lien 2:</strong> the town sees them as an odd family of dog breeders</li><li><strong>Portillon 4:</strong> open fields, dogs, a single gravel road, and the tunnel to the river</li></ul>",
